Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/JastRedPanda/Nimbus
Description: Weather tray app with 7-day forecast and settings GUI (GTK)
 Nimbus displays current temperature and weather conditions in the
 system tray. Features 7-day forecast, configurable units, themes,
 and language support (English/Українська).
 .
 This build draws its windows with GTK 3. For a Qt desktop - Plasma,
 LXQt, Deepin - install nimbus-qt instead; the two can be installed
 side by side and share one configuration file.
